Section 8 — Applicant Certification and Signature
The applicant certifies that:
1.The information provided in this application is true and correct to the best of the applicant's knowledge.
2.The proposed facility will be designed, installed, and operated in conformance with the Alleniom DER
Interconnection Standard (DIS-01, Rev 4) and IEEE 1547-2018.
3.Post-execution changes to nameplate capacity or point of interconnection will be handled per DIS-01 §7
(withdrawal and reapplication) and are not requested here.
4.The applicant will notify the DER Program Office in writing of any change to the contact of record,
project ownership, or site address.
